---
layout: base.njk
title: Sessions
description: Indexed sessions from Airspace World 2026 — plenaries, panels, and deep-dives across the eight ASW 2026 themes.
permalink: /sessions/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Sessions</p>
    <h1>The ASW 2026 agenda, structured</h1>
    <p>Every plenary, panel, and deep-dive indexed and linked to its theme. Schedule data is refreshed weekly from the official CANSO programme.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="list-grid">
      {% for session in collections.sessions %}
        <a class="list-card" href="{{ session.url }}">
          <p class="list-card-meta">{{ session.data.day }} · {{ session.data.time }} · {{ session.data.room }}</p>
          <h3>{{ session.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ session.data.summary }}</p>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
